[{"title":"采茶女","author":"蔡见先","text":"前村残月尚朦胧，路入茶田第几重。\n叶露香黏纤指腻，花风凉袭小鬟松。\n短歌相答莺喉软，嫩色才抽雀舌浓。\n采得盈筐好归去，莫教野蝶尾行踪。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4245,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夏闺词","author":"蔡见先","text":"万叶阴成绿满梢，日长昼永线针抛。\n藕丝试雪看泥拔，环佩鸣风和竹敲。\n愠解焦琴歌曲熟，凉招团扇爱恩包。\n无端妒煞鸳鸯处，梦稳荷池颈刎交。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4246,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"鸡声","author":"蔡见先","text":"数遍铜壶漏半欹，嘐嘐底事报偏迟。\n闺人好梦三更勖，壮士雄心一剑知。\n秋草野桥霜印外，晓风茅店月斜时。\n老夫封事明朝急，听汝连番嘱侍儿。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4247,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"向日葵","author":"蔡添福","text":"晓起娇姿正向东，黄昏转对夕阳红。\n倾心只解趋炎势，枉负滋深雨露功。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4248,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"谒延平王庙 其一","author":"蔡德辉","text":"沙汕纷纷列舳舻，当年海上拓雄图。\n鲸鱼入梦生何异，龙种偕来类不孤。\n人似武侯筹北伐，地同洛邑建东都。\n知他矢志延明祚，绝岛偏安亦丈夫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4249,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"谒延平王庙 其二","author":"蔡德辉","text":"红旗赤帜树高城，弱冠将军独请缨。\n宠赉有加天赐姓，徵收无处海屯兵。\n都缘耿耿心长在，岂为区区发数茎。\n忠孝由来难两尽，邮书往返不胜情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4250,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"谒延平王庙 其三","author":"蔡德辉","text":"森严刁斗拥熊罴，赏罚分明未足奇。\n只望一身存胜代，敢将两岛抗全师。\n图开赤嵌形堪踞，业复朱家势莫支。\n智力难争天命在，多君风调俨须眉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4251,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"谒延平王庙 其四","author":"蔡德辉","text":"才尤刚决节尤坚，和议连番总不然。\n百计筹谋惟报国，一时流寓况名贤。\n便教藩服能成事，其奈孱躯不永年。\n史册流芳终有分，漫将遗恨播诗篇。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4252,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"吊郑成功","author":"郑以庠","text":"乾坤板荡有馀悲，两岛孤军抗八旗。\n今日思明洲畔过，斜阳衰草访残碑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4253,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和陈槐庭词兄却扇词","author":"郑以庠","text":"枯肠日饮润如酥，醉过消寒九九图。\n自笑玉川唯赤脚，锦囊收拾当奚奴。\n琴瑟和鸣等断金，筝琶添奏意犹深。\n愿卿休咏江沱句，旁挺离支惬素心。\n轻盈二八绮罗身，南脸西眉画不真。\n他日颛房须仔细，妒鳞防逆比肩人。\n豆蔻香浓二月梢，游蜂恰好借为巢。\n东风似喜开生面，连理枝头又吐苞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4254,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"铁砧山吊郑延平","author":"郑家珍","text":"风云彷佛护灵旗，忠节曾闻此驻师。\n漫说归东鲸应谶，空传吊古凤来悲。\n耿恭昔下甘泉拜，宋启终歌彼黍离。\n眢井犹存波不起，苔痕斑驳认残碑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4255,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬至搓丸诗","author":"郑家珍","text":"五纹添线日初长，佳节团圆乐未央。\n珠落玉盘丸脱手，还劳窈窕作羹汤。\n粉丸风味话枌乡，佳节初逢复一阳。\n妇卜宜男儿肖物，灯前手续大家忙。\n深闺五夜一灯光，女手纤纤作粉忙。\n犹忆儿时当此日，戏堆鸡犬满盘霜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4256,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"鸡声","author":"郑鹏云","text":"灯窗结伴感闻鸡，戒旦年来累小妻。\n万里雄心频起舞，五更残梦促羁栖。\n板桥迹印留鸿爪，函谷关开趁马蹄。\n绛帻有人同报晓，霜华满地月轮西。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4257,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"红梅","author":"郑鹏云","text":"聘得海棠真艳福，也从脂粉洗寒冰。\n夕阳一角花千朵，误把罗浮作武陵。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4258,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海物杂咏","author":"郑鹏云","text":"银鳞肥美品无双，多骨何须恨满腔。\n最是荔支将熟后，馋涎忆到富春江。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4259,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海物杂咏","author":"郑鹏云","text":"鳒鲽名笺尔雅图，双游忘却在江湖。\n伤心反目惭于汝，忍作王馀片影孤。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4260,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋雁用王渔洋秋柳原韵","author":"郑鹏云","text":"淮南秋雨黯销魂，归思悠悠自掩门。\n疏柳残蝉才绝响，空梁去燕杳无痕。\n横塘菰米波千顷，浅渚芦花月一村。\n瑶瑟有弦筝有柱，不胜清怨曲中论。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4261,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"天然足","author":"郑鹏云","text":"女界文明局一新，羞将束缚损天真。\n潘家莲瓣杨家袜，今日何人肯效颦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4262,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雁门烟雨","author":"卢九围","text":"罗汉苍茫锁洞门，鸿飞不到别乾坤。\n烟迷绿霭山山隐，雨暗长空树树昏。\n岂似潇湘秋弄色，空怀雁阵夜销魂。\n拟同浮石湖中迹，候得时来报远村。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4263,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"椰酒","author":"卢九围","text":"几度酿蛮烟，苍苍高树巅。\n棕分千缕结，核破一瓜圆。\n玉液真神异，苍匏出自然。\n何须誇醴酒，直欲胜甘泉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4264,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"郊望","author":"赖世英","text":"平田草长变荒原，兵燹遭馀几剩村。\n云树苍茫迷远道，落花流水问无言。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4265,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"观潮","author":"赖世观","text":"立身海上钓鱼台，尽日潮声去复来。\n漫说渔翁能遁世，风波满目打难开。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4266,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"悟道 其一","author":"赖世观","text":"半积阴功半读书，乾坤到处是吾庐。\n逍遥莫把尘牵住，洗涤聊将志畅舒。\n有酒醉眠明月窟，无吟含笑白云居。\n此身曾作登瀛梦，今日閒来看太虚。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4267,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"悟道 其二","author":"赖世观","text":"混元一气界三千，日月流行转大天。\n动植飞潜循自性，人生代谢几多年。\n惟留品节名长在，空费英雄策万全。\n世事做完空手去，后身未了续前缘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4268,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"剃头","author":"赖世观","text":"搔首踟蹰散发时，刀光皎处鬓如丝。\n吕仙妙术今犹在，留作工夫世上奇。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4269,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"水仙花 其一","author":"赖世观","text":"玉盏金盘霁月天，深宵醉向好风前。\n沙明水净神清冷，不染纤埃便是仙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4270,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"水仙花 其二","author":"赖世观","text":"嫩蕊娉婷出水开，冰肌玉质绝尘埃。\n神凝沙石清如许，惯向春风送馥来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4271,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋尽","author":"赖绍尧","text":"霜风谡谡度空林，重九才过岁又侵。\n感遇未成芳草句，悲秋肯拟槁梧吟。\n消磨白发非初志，睥睨青樽起壮心。\n漫道床头无长物，篱边尚有万黄金。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4272,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"落花","author":"赖绍尧","text":"匆匆百五好韶光，不信花飞有底忙。\n一缕香魂随逝水，连天红雨作啼妆。\n海棠未见梅行聘，桃树难教李代僵。\n草就绿章无处诉，含冤我欲问巫阳。\n烟雨迷濛夕照昏，满园春色带啼痕。\n桃花空说三千岁，苦楝刚逢廿四番。\n即有綵丝难系命，断无玉琯可回温。\n茫茫瘴海凭飞渡，可念维摩病掩门。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4273,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"抵任","author":"钱琦","text":"四溟中断早潮回，铁板沙礁面面开。\n天设鹿门严锁钥，地疑蜃气幻楼台。\n使槎远载春光到，官府喧传上界来。\n合是前身香案吏，江山管领到蓬莱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4274,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"荷钱","author":"钱登选","text":"片片荷钱贴水云，依稀数得又缤纷。\n漫云铜臭输人笑，可有芳情扑鼻闻。\n世上蝇头休弄巧，水中蚨影自成群。\n沙鸥最是忘机侣，惯看何曾取一文。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4275,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"画竹","author":"谢颖苏","text":"榕坛风月本双清，十笏山斋构竹成。\n添写筼筜千万个，夜深同此听秋声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4276,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"蚁战","author":"简楫","text":"蠢尔因何事，纷纷斗不休。\n溃堤殚众力，伏穴有深谋。\n渡竹编成阵，趋膻誓报雠。\n输他蜂蝶乐，花国日酣游。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4277,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"乙未1895避乱崇武归舟阻风泊观音澳","author":"魏绍吴","text":"乾坤战伐总堪伤，魂梦无因泣数行。\n巨浪连天争簸舞，扁舟一叶共低昂。\n岂期绝海逢孤岛，何处青山认故乡。\n记得乱离秋八月，观音澳上几徬徨。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4278,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"课子","author":"魏绍吴","text":"课子从来望岂奢，要令清白继吾家。\n读书明理资修养，守分安贫莫怨嗟。\n俯仰问心求不愧，浮沉于道贵无差。\n中原倘有兴隆日，祭祀毋忘告阿爷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4279,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"次韵送林小眉之鹭门","author":"罗秀惠","text":"乾坤放眼更谁怜，云水情移海上连。\n埋首债台千垒块，等身价值五铢钱。\n骊歌三叠春迟饯，画鹢分飞缆莫牵。\n安借天风听雅奏，浪浪镇日抵长年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4280,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"星眸","author":"罗秀惠","text":"睥睨繁华已自伤，可曾醉眼注欢场。\n微波通线谁平视，阿堵传神半抑扬。\n银海蚌含珠界粉，晶帘鸿送月流黄。\n撩人最是如何夜，真个销魂欲断肠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4281,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"帘影","author":"罗秀惠","text":"隐约堆云漏角尖，重檐痕讶宿花添。\n分明银蒜凌波漾，低抹金莲贴地纤。\n捲动香风惊醉蝶，护将青琐认移蟾。\n画屏红烛人何处，背押薰笼隔幌拈。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4282,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"无题三十首步悔痴韵","author":"罗秀惠","text":"闷无聊赖剔银釭，明月缘悭隔一窗。\n象外逍遥空是色，花间形影独成双。\n秋风作客偏输燕，枕梦惊魂醒吠尨。\n寂寞离愁何自遣，葡萄美酒木兰艭。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4283,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"无题三十首步悔痴韵","author":"罗秀惠","text":"别后酸辛脉脉含，天涯何地息征骖。\n羁些意马群空北，深样情波浦忆南。\n节候已随凉气改，醉心不为薄醪酣。\n无情最是中秋月，偏照离人对影惭。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4284,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"凤山任满留别","author":"丁居信","text":"海峤欣逢报政年，愧无异绩纪瑶编。\n灯残细阅琴堂卷，雨后勤观绿野田。\n八社莺声迟驿使，半屏日色促行鞭。\n临歧依恋无他祝，大有频歌入舜弦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4285,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"乙丑立春得春字 其二","author":"六十七","text":"葭管灰旋万象新，东风吹彻海天春。\n会须遍播阳和意，岛屿民皆击壤民。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4286,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"人日","author":"六十七","text":"缕金剪綵我何知，祇望阴晴卜岁时。\n胜事浑输高尚客，草堂挥麈正题诗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4287,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"竹城感怀 其一","author":"方祖荫","text":"三十年来逐宦场，自怜肝胆照秋霜。\n胸中别有炎凉意，半是冰心半热肠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4288,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"竹城感怀 其二","author":"方祖荫","text":"捧檄东来宰海滨，一官惟恐负君亲。\n口碑满地吾翻愧，不信公评竟有人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4289,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"五妃庙怀古","author":"王子典","text":"野庙连坟何代冢，凤阳妃子节堪尊。\n歌残玉带悲千种，惨尽金枝葬一墩。\n御史范咸修墓碣，益王俨子绍儿孙。\n南郊吊古增惆怅，月下凄凉姊妹魂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4290,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"蛇","author":"王子典","text":"画来添足行惟捷，屈处藏身捲作屯。\n生活自存巴象大，毒牙遮莫肆鲸吞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4291,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"炸弹","author":"王竹修","text":"世界而今唱大同，鱼雷鸟铳总无功。\n轰天炸炮休轻发，惟有攻心是至公。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4292,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"走马灯","author":"王竹修","text":"篝灯纸马玉堂前，竟把章台故事传。\n鞭影迷离环一炬，轮蹄瞬息跃千旋。\n焰张博望成灰烬，骑践咸阳不瓦全。\n无限风光随处转，更从后苑看鞦韆。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4293,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏五指山","author":"王松","text":"五笏巍峨冠海东，巨灵伸手欲摩空。\n夜来遥见峰头月，一颗明珠弄掌中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4294,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夏霁即景","author":"王松","text":"黄梅雨过放晴天，长夏幽居地自偏。\n碧到衣襟蕉映绿，光摇帘幕水生妍。\n湿云夺得千山色，残照微烘别浦烟。\n时觉栏东炎暑退，风杨骄噪抱枝蝉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4295,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"村夜偶作","author":"王松","text":"黄昏家宴后，月色满长林。\n扫石留花影，推窗纳鸟音。\n山遥如墨画，水韵不弦琴。\n小婢知人意，烹茶助苦吟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4296,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"病起偶得书示奎儿","author":"王松","text":"病来鹤骨笑支离，叟本支离不用医。\n秃柳风凄垂老别，寒桃雨泣少年嫠。\n无情岁月消歌哭，有路云山入梦思。\n身后浮名聊自惜，深杯酌我且教儿。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4297,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"岁暮感怀","author":"王学潜","text":"怅恨驹光似掷梭，几茎白发影婆娑。\n半生空负凌云志，举世谁怜击筑歌。\n把酒待迎新岁月，临轩惭看旧山河。\n惊心马齿年年长，拱璧分阴肯放过。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4298,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"敬和栖霞先生鸟松阁作","author":"王蓝玉","text":"大树将军气势雄，鸟松高峙挂晴虹。\n使君阁上徵佳咏，萃得诗人在个中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4299,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"敬和栖霞先生鸟松阁作","author":"王蓝玉","text":"风月阁中自一天，老松环抱暑无权。\n台澎坐理升平日，公退吟馀意适然。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4300,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"五妃墓","author":"王蓝石","text":"昭君节烈胜昏昏，冢草长青扫淡痕。\n二百年来名不朽，山灵时觉护香魂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4301,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和栖霞先生鸟松阁作 其一","author":"王蓝石","text":"虬龙拱抱拂天雄，倚日凌云气吐虹。\n画阁巍峨传鸟语，赓诗唱和乐其中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4302,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和栖霞先生鸟松阁作 其二","author":"王蓝石","text":"耸翠翻青拟绿天，一生诗酒两司权。\n公馀阁下邀兰友，共听绵蛮兴适然。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4303,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梦蝶园","author":"丘逢甲","text":"二百年前老道人，曾从此地托閒身。\n草鸡已叹雄图改，花蝶犹寻旧院春。\n心事自同黄檗苦，遗民犹见白衣新。\n如何栗主无人祀，有客伤心荐藻蘋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4304,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"苔","author":"丘逢甲","text":"惹草拈花一片同，眼前随意绿濛濛。\n空山剔翠寻秦碣，古砌分青上汉铜。\n钱样堆残贫士壁，鞋痕香透美人弓。\n石头路滑匆匆去，怕忆天台旧梦中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4305,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"辛卯1891首春招同赖俊臣徐炯尔赖远澜苏祥其王师竹林行仁游玉枕山由大仙岩抵碧云寺题壁","author":"丘逢甲","text":"策杖来探海外奇，春风吹客出城时。\n路从虎墓穿林曲，泉绕麟岩下涧迟。\n窥井少酬诸葛志，搴云同赋大苏诗。\n庄严尚鲜开山手，何处谈禅觅戒师。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4306,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"元夕无月","author":"丘逢甲","text":"满城灯市荡春烟，宝月沉沉隔海天。\n看到六鳌仙有泪，神山沦没已三年。\n三年此夕月无光，明月多应在故乡。\n欲向海天寻月去，五更飞梦渡鲲洋。\n鲲洋梦断夜潮寒，佳节偏怜见月难。\n十二楼台春寂寂，满身花露倚栏杆。\n倚栏痴待月华来，万斛春愁酒一杯。\n恨煞蛮云遮隔住，东风无力为吹开。\n蛮云黯黯海天昏，冷对春灯忆梦痕。\n今月纵明输古月，更无人说夺昆崙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4307,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"东山感秋词次康步崖中翰题壁韵","author":"丘逢甲","text":"痛哭秋风又一年，觚棱梦落练江天。\n拾遗冷作诸侯客，袍笏空山拜杜鹃。\n天涯心逐白云飞，瑟瑟秋芦点客衣。\n回首大宛山上月，更无缄札问当归。\n斜日江声走急滩，残棋别墅局方难。\n后堂那有閒丝竹，陶写东山老谢安。\n寒蛟海上趁人来，漠漠秋尘扫不开。\n满目桑田清浅水，五云楼阁失蓬莱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4308,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"论诗次铁庐韵","author":"丘逢甲","text":"元音从古本天生，何事时流务竞争。\n诗世界中几雄国，惜无人起与连衡。\n迩来诗界唱革命，谁果独尊吾未逢。\n流尽玄黄笔头血，茫茫词海战群龙。\n新筑诗中大舞台，侏儒几辈剧堪哀。\n即今开幕推神手，要选人天绝代才。\n台上风云发浩歌，不须猛士再搜罗。\n拔山妄费重瞳力，夜半虞兮唱奈何。\n北派南宗各自誇，可能流响脱淫哇。\n诗中果有真王在，四海何妨共一家。\n彼此纷纷说界疆，谁知世有大文章。\n中天北斗都无定，浮海观星上大郎。\n芭蕉雪里供摹写，绝妙能诗王右丞。\n米雨欧风作吟料，岂同隆古事无徵。\n四海横流未定居，千村万落废犁锄。\n荆州失后吟梁父，空忆南阳旧草庐。\n展卷重吟民主篇，海山东望独悽然。\n英雄成败凭人论，赢得诗中自纪年。\n四海都知有蛰庵，重开诗史作雄谈。\n大禽大兽今何世，目极全球战正酣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4309,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台阳八景","author":"朱仕玠","text":"试上高楼倚画栏，半空积素布晴峦。\n谁知海岛三秋雪，绝胜峨嵋六月寒。\n自有清光摇棨戟，翻拟馀冷沁冰纨。\n北来羁客乡思切，时向炎天矫首看。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4310,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]